# Carnage, Crimson Chaos puts the creature card onto the battlefield without casting it, so a replacement effect applies:
# Bot2's Containment Priest ("If a nontoken creature would enter and it wasn't cast, exile it instead") exiles the
# Llanowar Elves instead (it does not enter), and nothing is gained by it. Carnage herself was cast, so she enters.
# Faithless Looting discards the Elves and an Island on turn 1; Bot2 has the Priest on turn 2.

